   67/   F :                            irq4_handler:
   68/   F :                            ; IRQ4 handler: fractional timer dither + micro-op dispatch.
   69/   F :                            ; SPH holds an 8-bit dither pattern (from pitch_output ROM[$0232] table).
   70/   F :                            ; Each IRQ4: rotate pattern left, carry adds 0 or 1 to timer reload.
   71/   F :                            ; This dithers the sample rate by ±1 timer tick, giving 3 bits of
   72/   F :                            ; sub-sample pitch resolution (8 dither patterns = 0/8 to 7/8 fractional).
   73/   F : 90 FE                              RL      0FEh                            ; 0FE=SPH (phase accumulator high)
