  498/ 232 :                            ; === DDS fractional frequency table (8 entries, read by dac_output_setup at $0DF8) ===
  499/ 232 :                            ;   Each entry has N set bits for N/8 fractional timer increment.
  500/ 232 :                            ;   Bit patterns maximize temporal spacing (minimize jitter).
  501/ 232 :                            ;   IRQ4: RL $FE; ADC R6,R4 → carry from rotation dithers timer rate.
  502/ 232 :                                    ORG     0232h
  503/ 232 : 00                                 DB      00h     ; [0] 00000000  0/8 fractional
  504/ 233 : 01                                 DB      01h     ; [1] 00000001  1/8 fractional
  505/ 234 : 11                                 DB      11h     ; [2] 00010001  2/8 fractional
  506/ 235 : 15                                 DB      15h     ; [3] 00010101  3/8 fractional
  507/ 236 : 55                                 DB      55h     ; [4] 01010101  4/8 fractional
  508/ 237 : EA                                 DB      0EAh    ; [5] 11101010  5/8 fractional
  509/ 238 : EE                                 DB      0EEh    ; [6] 11101110  6/8 fractional
  510/ 239 : FE                                 DB      0FEh    ; [7] 11111110  7/8 fractional
